      "descriptions": {
        "shortDescriptionText": "A training camp for future adventurers, Junior Explorers Camp depicts three distinct zones of natural environments, each enriched by beloved Disney Animation stories such as the wild savanna of The Lion King, and Pixar stories like the ocean wonders of Finding Nemo and the cloud-high adventures of Up. Through a wide array of fun and exhilarating themed outdoor activities, from rope courses and climbing towers to slides and stair challenges, young guests can unleash their energy!",
        "shortDescriptionMobileText": "A training camp for future adventurers, Junior Explorers Camp depicts three distinct zones of natural environments, each enriched by beloved Disney Animation stories such as the wild savanna of The Lion King, and Pixar stories like the ocean wonders of Finding Nemo and the cloud-high adventures of Up. Through a wide array of fun and exhilarating themed outdoor activities, from rope courses and climbing towers to slides and stair challenges, young guests can unleash their energy!"
      },
